    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00ff330f00129334",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这个 Space 中，或在下方嵌入的交互体验区中，轻松试用 Big Falcon Model（400 亿参数！）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65dd73dba056a38b",
      "translationZh": "在底层，这个交互体验区使用了 Hugging Face 的 Text Generation Inference，这是一个可扩展的 Rust、Python 和 gRPC 服务器，用于快速、高效地生成文本。HuggingChat 使用的也是同一项技术。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3de150e633c1f15a",
      "translationZh": "我们还构建了 7B 指令模型的 Core ML 版本，以下是它在 M1 MacBook Pro 上的运行情况：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c453c822fe7d574",
      "translationZh": "视频展示了一个轻量级应用，它借助一个 Swift 库完成繁重的工作：模型加载、分词、输入准备、生成和解码。我们正忙于构建这个库，让开发者能够将强大的大语言模型集成到各种应用中，而无需重复造轮子。它仍有些粗糙，但我们已经迫不及待地想与你分享了。在此期间，你可以从仓库下载 Core ML 权重，自行探索！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae5b8a4c6ac9aa79",
      "translationZh": "推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0bc783b05633d5b",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用熟悉的 transformers API，在自己的硬件上运行这些模型，但需要注意几个细节：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5955b44f497226de",
      "translationZh": "这些模型在训练时使用了 bfloat16 数据类型，因此我们建议你使用相同的数据类型。这需要较新版本的 CUDA，并且在新款显卡上效果最佳。你也可以尝试使用 float16 进行推理，但请记住，这些模型是使用 bfloat16 进行评估的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba284c1c30db23a6",
      "translationZh": "你需要允许远程代码执行。这是因为这些模型使用了一种新架构，尚未纳入 transformers；所需代码由模型作者在仓库中提供。具体来说，如果你允许远程执行，将会使用以下文件中的代码（以 falcon-7b-instruct 为例）：configuration_RW.py、modelling_RW.py。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62fe9bd914ae6ef8",
      "translationZh": "考虑到这些因素，你可以使用 transformers pipeline API，像这样加载 7B 指令模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f596fedabc69df66",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以使用如下代码运行文本生成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e29455775c5af872",
      "translationZh": "你可能会得到类似下面的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "75d16bd9a322d38f",
      "translationZh": "Falcon 40B 的推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d096da09ff9d4341",
      "translationZh": "由于模型体积庞大，运行 40B 模型颇具挑战：它无法装入单张配备 80 GB 显存的 A100。以 8 位模式加载时，运行它大约需要 45 GB 显存，因此可以装入 A6000（48 GB），但无法装入 40 GB 版本的 A100。你可以这样操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91eb8922b5aa06ce",
      "translationZh": "但请注意，混合 8 位推理会使用 torch.float16，而非 torch.bfloat16，因此务必充分测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1d043ec6ce53414",
      "translationZh": "如果你有多张显卡，并且安装了 accelerate，就可以利用 device_map=\"auto\" 自动将模型层分配到不同的显卡上。必要时，它甚至可以将部分层卸载到 CPU，但这会影响推理速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d50465933700df2e",
      "translationZh": "你还可以使用最新版本的 bitsandbytes、transformers 和 accelerate 进行 4 位加载。在这种情况下，运行 40B 模型需要约 27 GB 显存。遗憾的是，这略高于 3090 或 4090 等显卡的可用显存，但足以在配备 30 或 40 GB 显存的显卡上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "77d5d964cc8855c4",
      "translationZh": "文本生成推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22c352b5975127bc",
      "translationZh": "Text Generation Inference 是由 Hugging Face 开发的、可用于生产环境的推理容器，旨在实现大型语言模型的便捷部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a6d78b99fc3e481",
      "translationZh": "其主要功能包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e57b752c3519af82",
      "translationZh": "连续批处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67e8349cf970b51d",
      "translationZh": "使用 Server-Sent Events (SSE) 进行令牌流式传输",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ffb7af48c96a07b",
      "translationZh": "Tensor Parallelism，可在多个 GPU 上实现更快的推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c22d34f42e93f77",
      "translationZh": "使用自定义 CUDA 内核优化的 transformers 代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0187d7a4a68adc67",
      "translationZh": "借助 Prometheus 和 Open Telemetry 实现可用于生产环境的日志记录、监控和追踪",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fea23c470296253a",
      "translationZh": "自 v0.8.2 起，Text Generation Inference 原生支持 Falcon 7b 和 40b 模型，无需依赖 Transformers 的“trust remote code”功能，从而支持严密安全的部署和安全审计。此外，Falcon 的实现包含自定义 CUDA 内核，可显著降低端到端延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b268819583f6b8f",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 现已支持 Text Generation Inference。通过 Int-8 量化，可轻松在 1xA100 上部署 Falcon 40B Instruct 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ffeda500c529bc6",
      "translationZh": "Text Generation Inference 现已集成到 Hugging Face 的 Inference Endpoints 中。要部署 Falcon 模型，请前往模型页面，点击 Deploy -> Inference Endpoints 控件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7ee852212a42303",
      "translationZh": "对于 7B 模型，我们建议选择“GPU [medium] - 1x Nvidia A10G”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d3cb79c8454dff4",
      "translationZh": "对于 40B 模型，您需要部署在“GPU [xlarge] - 1x Nvidia A100”上，并启用量化：Advanced configuration -> Serving Container -> Int-8 Quantization。注意：您可能需要通过电子邮件向 api-enterprise@huggingface.co 申请提高配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "797473bafec6fca1",
      "translationZh": "那么，Falcon 模型究竟有多出色？Falcon 的作者即将发布一份深入评估，在此之前，我们已使用开放式 LLM 基准测试对基础模型和指令模型进行了测试。该基准测试衡量 LLM 的推理能力，以及它们在以下领域提供真实答案的能力：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "36a7d70655e0e6af",
      "translationZh": "AI2 Reasoning Challenge (ARC)：小学水平的科学选择题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a758630abb364bc",
      "translationZh": "HellaSwag：围绕日常事件进行常识推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "862a8a31fdbb257b",
      "translationZh": "MMLU：涵盖57个学科（专业与学术领域）的选择题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f6e07cd6e66dd55",
      "translationZh": "TruthfulQA：测试模型将事实与一组经过对抗性选择的不正确陈述区分开的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a57cc65a25e9df47",
      "translationZh": "结果显示，40B基础模型和指令模型都非常强，目前在LLM排行榜上分别排名第1和第2！🏆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a06de27baddbf7be",
      "translationZh": "正如Thomas Wolf所指出的，这里一个出人意料的洞见是，40B模型预训练所使用的计算量约为训练LLaMa 65B所需计算量的一半（2800与6300 petaflop days相比），这表明我们似乎还没有完全触及LLM预训练“最优”状态的极限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc81c05ae77804e2",
      "translationZh": "对于7B模型，我们看到基础模型优于llama-7b，并且略胜MosaicML的mpt-7b，成为当前这一规模下最优秀的预训练LLM。下面列出排行榜上的一些热门模型，以供比较：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
